      "value": "Here's two different pov's of people dancing along with a video:\nhttps://clips.twitch.tv/TrustworthyWrongTarsierFailFish\nhttps://t.co/ZEpGchIGRv\nFrom my pov I'm slightly ahead of everyone else\nFrom my friend's pov I was pretty far behind\nIt seems that everyone is seeing everything with a 1-2 second delay. You can't even change your speed to try to sync up because everyone is seeing something different",
